Summary: Export __wine_unix_call from ntdll.dll for D3DMetal's DLLs
Category: graphics
Kind: feature
Feature: d3dmetal
Origin: crossover
  Version: 26.3.0
  CW-Hacks: 22435
  URL: https://media.codeweavers.com/pub/crossover/source/crossover-sources-26.3.0.tar.gz
  Files: dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec, dlls/ntdll/loader.c
  Changes: verbatim (the ntdll part of CW HACK 22435)
  Note: the winemac.drv part of CW HACK 22435 is
    winemac-export-macdrv-functions, the wine.inf part
    wine-inf-d3dmetal-placeholder-dlls. Sikarugir 10.0_8 ships it: its x86_64
    and i386 ntdll.dll export __wine_unix_call; ours didn't (the only export
    difference across the PE DLLs, 2026-11-15)
Upstream: no
Why: D3DMetal's PE DLLs (d3d12, dxgi and nvngx in D3DMetal 3.0) import
 __wine_unix_call from ntdll.dll by name to reach their Unix side; WineHQ
 exports only __wine_unix_call_dispatcher, so they fail to load. This
 exports a function of that name that wraps the inline __wine_unix_call.
 Nothing calls it unless such a DLL is loaded; DXMT doesn't use it. No copy
 for Wine 11.x, where D3DMetal 3.0 can't run.
Programs: none known
Enable: see ntdll-renderer-dll-paths (WINEDLLPATH_D3DMETAL)
Status: 10.0: 2026-11-26: header only; the 11.21/11.22 copy is dropped (D3DMetal
 can't run there). In build0

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
index 74546db..f10caaa 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -3896,6 +3896,17 @@ NTSTATUS WINAPI __wine_ctrl_routine( void *arg )
 }
 
 
+/***********************************************************************
+ *              __wine_unix_call
+ *
+ * CW HACK 22435: Needed by D3DMetal PE DLLs
+ */
+NTSTATUS WINAPI __wine_unix_call_exported( unixlib_handle_t handle, unsigned int code, void *args )
+{
+    return __wine_unix_call( handle, code, args );
+}
+
+
 /***********************************************************************
  *           __wine_unix_spawnvp
  */
diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec b/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec
index 620d96a..f14e9a8 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec
@@ -1757,6 +1757,9 @@
 @ cdecl wine_get_build_id()
 @ cdecl wine_get_host_version(ptr ptr)
 
+# CW HACK 22435
+@ stdcall __wine_unix_call(int64 long ptr) __wine_unix_call_exported
+
 # Filesystem
 @ stdcall -syscall wine_nt_to_unix_file_name(ptr ptr ptr long)
 @ stdcall -syscall wine_unix_to_nt_file_name(str ptr ptr)
